@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 210
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 75
hide circle
hide empty members
package "付款分配与批准释放" as U {
' @reference patient_payment
class "患者付款" as payment_U <<entity>>
' @reference bill
class "应收账目" as bill_U <<entity>>
' @reference fee_request
class "费用申请" as request_U <<entity>>
class "付款分配" as payment_allocation <<entity>> {
 带符号金额、生效时间
 经办人、分配或释放原因
 --
 +核对可分配原款与待付()
 +登记本账用途()
 +释放原用途(批准申请)
 +汇总有效用途净额()
}
payment_U "1" -- "0..*" payment_allocation
bill_U "1" -- "0..*" payment_allocation
request_U "0..1" -- "0..*" payment_allocation
' @reference payment_allocation
class "付款分配" as allocation_previous <<entity>>
allocation_previous "原用途\n0..1" -- "0..*" payment_allocation
payment_U -[hidden]right- bill_U
bill_U -[hidden]right- request_U
note bottom of payment_allocation
分配与抵扣仅记录资金用途，同一用途不重复入账。
负数仅释放有依据的原正向用途，累计不超原额；
与批准调整共同生效；退款另记录真实交付结果。
end note
}
@enduml
